OL,3,GNEWSACocaine found in milk bottle of
OL,4,Atoddler who died
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother has been jailed along with her
OL,7,Fboyfriend after the death of her
OL,8,Ftwo-year-old daughter who had a "fatal
OL,9,Fquantity" of cocaine in her milk
OL,10,Fbottle.
OL,12,FEmergency services were called to an
OL,13,Faddress in Billingham in April 2024,
OL,14,Fafter reports Laylah Hatch had stopped
OL,15,Fbreathing.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
