OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACocaine found in milk bottle of
OL,4,Atoddler who died
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer mother Jodie Hatch, 22, and her
OL,7,Fpartner Dale Mathie, 30, initially
OL,8,Fdenied two offences of child cruelty in
OL,9,Frelation to Laylah and a second child.
OL,10,FThey changed their pleas to guilty
OL,11,Fduring a trial at Teesside Crown Court
OL,12,Fand were sentenced on Monday.
OL,14,FA toxicology report found there was a
OL,15,Flethal quantity of cocaine in the
OL,16,Fchild's milk bottle, and the drug was
OL,17,Falso found in her blood, stomach
OL,18,Fcontents and hair strands.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
